# double nearest its published decimal (the label). The records, with the sources' URLs and sha256s and each
# mass's verbatim AME2020 line, are scripts/oracle/isotopes.tsv. Rust 1.2.0's table rounds the masses to five
# decimals and omits ³⁶S (its sulfur sums to 0.9999): its values are the golden rows', these their ADR 0002 #23
# notes.
